  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "See https://github.com/JefferyLeo/boostgrid/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md for the full per-version log. v2.5.1 is a metadata + docs patch: fixes the CDN script-tag MIME issue (package now resolves to dist/boostgrid.umd.js so browsers don't refuse to execute it), surfaces a previously-silent option-drop when data-toggle=\"boostgrid\" auto-init races an explicit attach() call (now warns via console.warn), and adds Ajax wire-format reference tables to the docs site. Shipped JavaScript is byte-identical to 2.5.0. v2.5.0 introduced element pooling under virtual scroll and the scrollToRow(index) public method. Bundle 16.41 KB brotli, ceiling 18 KB.",
